    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic survival-horror gameplay meets open-world exploration</strong> in this single-player, atmospheric, first-person adventure. <br><strong></strong><br><strong>Explore and uncover the deep mysteries of <i>Veilmoor Isl</i></strong><i>e</i>, an eerie secluded island shrouded in secrecy and rumor. <br>All alone, you must use your wits while searching every corner of the island's various structures to <strong>gather</strong> <strong>key items, precious resources, information and relics</strong> needed to <strong>solve puzzles and unlock pathways</strong> toward your great discovery.\u00a0<strong>Resources are scarce</strong>, use them wisely or your chances of survival will quickly diminish.\u00a0<strong>Your means of defense are limited</strong> and the few enemies you encounter are extremely dangerous, they should be avoided at all costs.<strong>\u00a0The choices you make will determine your ultimate fate</strong>.<br><br><i><strong>Code of Corruption</strong></i> is the debut title created by <strong>Polymath Digital Studio</strong>, a one-man studio along with various contributing artists and developers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic survival-horror gameplay meets open-world exploration</strong> in this single-player, atmospheric, first-person adventure. <br><strong></strong><br><strong>Explore and uncover the deep mysteries of <i>Veilmoor Isl</i></strong><i>e</i>, an eerie secluded island shrouded in secrecy and rumor. <br>All alone, you must use your wits while searching every corner of the island's various structures to <strong>gather</strong> <strong>key items, precious resources, information and relics</strong> needed to <strong>solve puzzles and unlock pathways</strong> toward your great discovery.\u00a0<strong>Resources are scarce</strong>, use them wisely or your chances of survival will quickly diminish.\u00a0<strong>Your means of defense are limited</strong> and the few enemies you encounter are extremely dangerous, they should be avoided at all costs.<strong>\u00a0The choices you make will determine your ultimate fate</strong>.<br><br><i><strong>Code of Corruption</strong></i> is the debut title created by <strong>Polymath Digital Studio</strong>, a one-man studio along with various contributing artists and developers.</p>",
